A||N||3||Monkeyman||CC/TS stalk questions||||1||
Z||000000||Monkeyman||05-13-2000||11:23 AM||||I thought I'd be smart and replace the ts stalk in the Grape Ape (washer lever is broken/CC) with the one from the Monkeymobile (washer lever is good, but no CC).  I just pulled the one out of the Mmobile and figured I could do the same with the one in the Grape Ape.  NOT!  I pulled the wires loose from the CC stalk!  I plan to install another (correct CC) stalk at some point (not enough $$ right now--any one want to set me up with a payment plan?).  How do I get the wires loose from inside the steering column??  Surely, I don't have to remove the steering wheel or steering column???  Need help...||||reg||1
Z||000001||batboy||05-13-2000||11:57 AM||||Yes, you have to remove the steering wheel and retainer plate, both of which needs special tools. The good news is that since the wire was for CC, you should be able to replace the old stalk with your other one (just leave the wire alone for now) and it should work (except the CC).||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||05-13-2000||12:32 PM||||I replaced the old stalk with the umm...other old stalk.  If I had used my brain, I would have tried superglue before ripping the old stalk out.  Stupid me. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Is the replacement a difficult task?  I don't have a problem with the steering wheel removal (just replaced the stock wheel--no biggie), but what about the retainer plate?  How are the wires connected in the steering column?  Hard wired or just a plug?||||reg||1
Z||000003||AL||05-13-2000||05:19 PM||||i just replaced mine and all i had to do is disconnect the wires from under the dash or panel and then i slowly pulled it out, then i moved the steering wheel up and snapped the new one in and with a thin wire i guided it in the column and once i brought it to the half way point i tied the wires with tape and pulled from the bottom slowly and i just connected the wires up and i was done, no removing the steering wheel at all just patience and a beer.good luck,AL.||||reg||6
